WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.188
Welcome to the Green Team Scribe orientation.

00:00:03.188 --> 00:00:06.900
Own Green Team's written decision record, preserve its rationale

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.275
, and hand complete work across the explicit review boundary

00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:10.438
.

00:00:10.438 --> 00:00:13.575
Your workflow moves from listening, to structured drafting,

00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:15.350
to an explicit handoff.

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:18.825
Use each surface to preserve the team’s intent, evidence

00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:21.113
, assumptions, and rationale.

00:00:21.113 --> 00:00:23.950
A record is not handed off merely because another role

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:24.900
can see it;

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.250
confirm the documented workflow state before you move on.
